The main response is to one ASCII space following an all-space token.
It is stronger near the document's beginning, weaker after very long
padding, and weaker for two successive single-space tokens. Repeated tabs
and nonbreaking spaces have smaller responses. Other tokens predict zero;
this deliberately omits the component's small, varied lexical responses.
